    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're saying that, but it feels so selfish to keep holding onto this life when everything feels so empty. it's like i'm just waiting for the other shoe to drop, or for the universe to correct the mistake. it would be so much more peaceful for everyone if the debt was just settled, you know? if things were finally balanced.",
